# Change Log

## 4.0.0

### Added

- Added the reworked AI API surface in `api-aiai.go` and `api-ai-*.go`: `AIAIAPIService`, `AIAssignmentsAPIService`, `AIAttachmentsAPIService`, `AIEditorToolsAPIService`, `AIExportAPIService`, `AIOpenAIPassthroughAPIService`, `AIPreferencesAPIService`, `AIProfilesAPIService`, `AIPromptsAPIService`, `AIThreadsAPIService`, `AIToolsAPIService`, `AIWebSearchAPIService`
- Added per-user AI settings endpoints and the matching models `AiAiUserSettingsDto`, `AiAiUserSettingsWrapper`, `AiAiSettingsDto`, `AiAiSettingsWrapper`

### Removed

- Removed the superseded AI API services `AIChatAPIService`, `AIMCPAPIService`, `AIMessagesAPIService` and `AIProvidersAPIService` from `api-ai-chat.go`, `api-aimcp.go`, `api-ai-messages.go` and `api-ai-providers.go`

### Fixed

- Fixed the generated code not compiling for optional query parameters that declare a default value (for example `refresh` in `SettingsDocsCloudAPIService`): the `if r.<param> != nil { ... } else { ... }` block was missing its closing brace before `else`, so the file failed with `syntax error: unexpected else, expected }`
- Fixed the usage sample not building: `samples/docspace-api-sdk-go-sample/go.mod` declared `go 1.22` while the SDK module requires `go >= 1.23.0`, so `go build` stopped with `module ../.. requires go >= 1.23.0`

## 3.7.0
- Initial release